],"note":"Inscriptions say a relic monster of 6 ft long inhabits Lost Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":1525.59,"y":165.13,"cell":988,"i":68,"name":"Torksey Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 33 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":797.13,"y":340.75,"cell":5740,"i":69,"name":"Faringdon Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 20 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":1224.3,"y":127.8,"cell":483,"i":70,"name":"Noss Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 25 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":567.15,"y":899.37,"cell":20387,"i":71,"name":"Chawleigh Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 30 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":600.41,"y":566,"cell":12786,"i":72,"name":"Ovixus Monster","tags":[],"note":"Elders speak of a great Monster who inhabits Ovixus hills and steals cattle at night."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":623.54,"y":534.32,"cell":11868,"i":73,"name":"Ramurelorum Cyclops","tags":[],"note":"Inscriptions speak of a hungry Cyclops who inhabits Ramurelorum hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1503.66,"y":149.9,"cell":787,"i":74,"name":"Kronausen Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Word of Tolfa."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1419.49,"y":143.43,"cell":680,"i":75,"name":"Fluorwihl Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Word of Tolfa."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":1472.73,"y":424.08,"cell":8543,"i":76,"name":"Cers Pinery","tags":[],"note":"A pinery sacred to local Keltan Pantheon."},{"icon":"glyph-1f334","type":"sacred-palm-groves","px":13,"x":1314.22,"y":467.14,"cell":9757,"i":77,"name":"Pinomargara Palm Grove","tags":[],"note":"A palm grove sacred to local Word of Tolfa."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":884.09,"y":376.8,"cell":7028,"i":78,"name":"Ratagustat Hyenas","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1457.04,"y":141.9,"cell":690,"i":79,"name":"Mahllstadbad Dogs","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1231.1,"y":214.5,"cell":1828,"i":80,"name":"Gernstertal Beavers","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1385.88,"y":706.71,"cell":17151,"i":81,"name":"Galvez Bisons","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1336.27,"y":101.89,"cell":328,"i":82,"name":"Kupbachlin Rats","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":891.9,"y":379.24,"cell":7029,"i":83,"name":"Lauratesium Falcons","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1059.4,"y":234.4,"cell":2277,"i":84,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1471.98,"y":789.44,"cell":19094,"i":85,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1493.4,"y":776.7,"cell":18820,"i":86,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":258.83,"y":300.58,"cell":4047,"i":87,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":556.65,"y":893.78,"cell":20384,"i":88,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1404.1,"y":99,"cell":295,"i":89,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1046.4,"y":523.3,"cell":11475,"i":90,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1283.5,"y":833.6,"cell":19739,"i":91,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":263.77,"y":454.06,"cell":9418,"i":92,"name":"Turorenna Runestone","tags":[],"note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༉༯༣༷་༤ༀ༘༢༬༡༈༤༫༐༚༻༇༃༶༣༄༾༌༴ༀ༺༰༕༻༬༔༰༩༜༃༡༸༽༆༥༈༢༗༁༯༦ༀ༅༶༧༛༫༤༳༮༸༈</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1304.08,"y":529.52,"cell":11753,"i":93,"name":"Pona Column","tags":[],"note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡀᡟᢡᡡᡔᡙᠻᡝᡰᢛᠦᡡᠡᡀᠭᠱ᠐ᡞᢐᡀᠨᢂᢡᠧ᠑ᠠ᠒ᡝᢂᠵᡯᡯᠽᡍᠮᡠᡰᠻᡠᢦᡲᡎᠭᠮᢠᠨᠽᠪᡙᡲ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1167.64,"y":667.91,"cell":15870,"i":94,"name":"Forcelsete Megalith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳹Ⳃ⳧ⲼⳬⳘⳔⳫⳎⳈⳭⳊⳁ⳩Ⳙ ⳄⳀⳀⳆⳎⳎⲼⳭⳲⳲⳠⳞⳆⳒⳐⳞ⳩⳥Ⳣ ⳥ⳘⳔⳤⲲ⳧ⳤⳘ⳹Ⲻ⳥ⳲⳂⳢⲼⳂⳫⳞⲼⳄⳈⳒⳭ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":892.19,"y":358.88,"cell":6289,"i":95,"name":"Etorina Obelisk","tags":[],"note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሀ ፈኀፐሠዘሐወጸረ አወመዘቀ ኀፐጰዘተኀ ጠዐጠተየተሠሀቀከነለረደወተዘረ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1206.8,"y":612.7,"cell":14418,"i":96,"name":"Lubriano Pillar","tags":[],"note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠔\udc0e\ud802𐠌\ud802\ud802 𐠠\ud802𐠼\udc05𐠠 𐠊\ud802\ud802𐠃\ud802 \udc31\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠓\ud802𐠛\udc30\udc3c\udc0a\udc05𐠄𐠎 \udc01\udc02\ud802 \udc32\udc2a\udc31\udc26\ud802𐠩\udc1a\udc35\udc12 𐠷\ud802𐠐𐠢\ud802\ud802𐠋\ud802 \udc20\udc0a\ud802 𐠁\udc03\udc14\udc13\udc11\udc22\ud802𐠏\ud802\ud802𐠟\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":448.88,"y":239.55,"cell":2392,"i":97,"name":"Ledevendi Obelisk","tags":[],"note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡖᠵᡭᡆᡆᡔᡙᡓᠻᢠᢋᢀᠩᢒᡓᡰᠭᡎᡀᡞᡕᠱᠮᢑᡞᠿᢂᠩᡀᢦ᠀ᠻᢒᡏᢦᠨᢜᡎᡲᢤᡝᠪ᠀ᢐᢛᡀᡲᡰᡝᡙᡲᢓᢂᡰᠱᡞᡡᢏᠻᡮᠻᠮᢐᠠᡰᡮᢒᠡ᠒ᢏᢦᡴᡓᡆᡁᢥᠵᠱᢓᡀᢤᠧᡯᠦᠼᡒᠲᡝᠩᡍᡀᡴᠮᡆᠦ᠐</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1318.68,"y":809.34,"cell":19434,"i":98,"name":"Fontini Stele","tags":[],"note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠐\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠑𐠥𐠡\ud802𐠗\udc2e𐠚\ud802𐠌\udc12\udc27\udc13𐠂\udc19\udc1b\udc15\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩\udc34\ud802\ud802𐠢𐠊\udc28\udc12\udc30𐠢\ud802𐠑𐠋\udc30\ud802𐠿\udc3c𐠑\ud802𐠿\udc08𐠢\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠞 𐠰\udc3f\udc3c\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1395.13,"y":245.5,"cell":2693,"i":99,"name":"Schomen Column","tags":[],"note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1c\ud802\ud802 \udc0a\udc2c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠟𐠭\ud802𐠼\udc22\udc3c\udc0a\udc2b𐠲𐠊\udc1d\udc22\udc27\udc19\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠋\udc2d\ud802 𐠊\ud802𐠢𐠍\ud802𐠚\udc26\udc2f\udc31\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc03\ud802𐠔𐠨\ud802𐠂 \udc26\udc02\udc05𐠈\udc0f\udc27𐠳\udc31\udc0d\udc34\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":345.5,"y":544.3,"cell":12055,"i":100,"name":"Durnum Obelisk","tags":[],"note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰገ በወሐተፐ የሐደቀለ ሐጸዐ ኀፐአጰዘፐተሠረቀየኀ ለዐተቀአፈረዘፐዘ  የ ሰፐወወሀ በፀፈነነመሰደለገሠረ ከፐረገዐተገ ኀበዘየተ የጸ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":421.36,"y":332.79,"cell":5394,"i":101,"name":"Confleneria Monument","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡗᠡᢋᠽᢑᡡᢥᡞᡲᠮᡮᡮᠦᠯᢏᠽᡆᠾᡟᡯᢥᡝᡯᠽᢐᠭᢥᠦᠡᡗᡠᠮᡏᠲᢤ᠀ᢜᠡᠨᠧᢒ᠒ᡠᡲᡠᡏᠼᢟᢜᢓᡙᢀᢢᡳᡗᡠᠧᠵᠻᢡᡕᡲᡟᢒᠿᠯᡏᢓᠡᡓᡎᢁᠨᡁᡱᡠᠳᡆᢦᠭᡏᢁᡏᡮᢟᢤᢒᡒᢞᢠᢁᡠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":535.2,"y":287.3,"cell":3606,"i":102,"name":"Noduricati Pillar","tags":[],"note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐነአተሐደሀሰነ ከጰወኀሀፈረ መረ ከ ጠዐ አአፈየመሰመጠዐ ሐተዐአተቀለዘአአኀፀሀገለኀየፐ ደ ፐጸጰወ  ተአሠየሀደጸፐጠመቀጸደደገ የረነ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1316.03,"y":701.18,"cell":16915,"i":103,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":714.94,"y":548.71,"cell":12345,"i":104,"name":"Ruined Fortification","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":704.3,"y":814.06,"cell":19487,"i":105,"name":"Ruined Castle","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":387.81,"y":224.3,"cell":1889,"i":106,"name":"Ruined Outpost","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1366.74,"y":587.88,"cell":13548,"i":107,"name":"Ruined Town","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":822.11,"y":270.35,"cell":3231,"i":108,"name":"Ruined Fortification","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1334.21,"y":562.56,"cell":12891,"i":109,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":785.53,"y":327.94,"cell":5194,"i":110,"name":"Ruined Castle","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":656.22,"y":789.6,"cell":18996,"i":111,"name":"Ruined Fortification","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":714.25,"y":203.57,"cell":1620,"i":112,"name":"Ruined City","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":742.57,"y":698.95,"cell":16835,"i":113,"name":"Ruined Sacred site","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":386.79,"y":564.93,"cell":12749,"i":114,"name":"Ruined City","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":795.24,"y":415.26,"cell":8223,"i":115,"name":"Ruined Town","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":474.67,"y":703.89,"cell":16793,"i":116,"name":"Suvaquin Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":280.29,"y":378.36,"cell":6937,"i":117,"name":"Travelling Magical Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":854.1,"y":267.1,"cell":3031,"i":118,"name":"Travelling Magical Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":435.19,"y":423.08,"cell":8393,"i":119,"name":"Travelling Magical Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":788.95,"y":279.42,"cell":3429,"i":120,"name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":461.6,"y":720.2,"cell":17219,"i":121,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":1409.5,"y":150.9,"cell":771,"i":122,"name":"Wildberg Joust","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a joust of might in Wildberg, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":782.84,"y":609.5,"cell":14128,"i":123,"name":"Lindinis Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Lindinis, offering local elephants, leather, and coal alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":832.2,"y":659.79,"cell":15605,"i":124,"name":"Minor Jetty","tags":[],"note":"A small location along the Tungdula River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1402.73,"y":647.03,"cell":15287,"i":125,"name":"Hyenas migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of hyenas are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f483-1f3fd","type":"dances","x":1589.96,"y":328.42,"cell":5319,"i":126,"name":"Aberffrwd exhibition","tags":[],"note":"A exhibition has been organised at Aberffrwd as a chance to gather the foreign dignitaries of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4a6","type":"mirage","x":400.41,"y":666.54,"cell":15751,"i":127,"name":"Peculiar mirage","tags":[],"note":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4a6","type":"mirage","x":1206.74,"y":673.51,"cell":16069,"i":128,"name":"Entrancing mirage","tags":[],"note":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":576.69,"y":517,"cell":11197,"i":129,"name":"Bicorum Ravine","tags":[],"note":"The Bicorum Ravine. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1471.38,"y":576.93,"cell":13345,"i":130,"name":"Wiscombe Cavern","tags":[],"note":"The Wiscombe Cavern. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1399.14,"y":609.6,"cell":14230,"i":131,"name":"Masegoso Tomb","tags":[],"note":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1511.51,"y":517.99,"cell":11320,"i":132,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/11320\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":149.05,"y":342.81,"cell":5630,"i":133,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/5630\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":897.01,"y":744.62,"cell":18079,"i"